<div class="tour-detail-hero" style="background-image: url('/assets/images/hero-silkroad.jpg');">
  <div class="container">
    <h1>16 Days Silk Road: Uzbekistan & China</h1>
    <div class="route">📍 Beijing → Xi'an → Lanzhou → Jiayuguan → Dunhuang → Turpan → Urumqi → Kashgar → Tashkent → Samarkand → Bukhara → Khiva</div>
